# Tessera v1 — dist tarball exclusion list (authoritative).
#
# This file is the single source of truth for what the distribution tarball
# MUST NOT contain. The tarball builder reads these patterns and refuses to
# ship anything matching them. The authoritative manifest is RFC-0013 §5.
#
# The tarball ships exactly (RFC-0013 §5): pyproject.toml, uv.lock, LICENSE,
# README.md, src/, install-modules/, e2e/. Everything else is excluded,
# including the build plumbing below that lives in dist/ but is NOT payload.

# --- Build plumbing (lives in dist/, never shipped) ---
install.sh
SOURCE_MANIFEST.txt
.distignore
*.tar.gz
*.sha256

# --- Never ship the staging dir or its outputs as payload ---
dist/

# --- Test suite (only the curated e2e/ subset ships; unit tests do not) ---
tests/
tests/test_*.py
tests/*_test.py

# --- Vendored docs repo + framework meta (never shipped) ---
formal-specifications/
.hermes/
.worktrees/

# --- Runtime / repo state (Invariants I-2 / I-5) ---
.ticket-runtime/
TicketsRepository/
Skills/
.tickets/

# --- Python / build cruft ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
build/
dist-info/

# --- Secrets / local env ---
.env
*.local.env

# --- Editor / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
*.swp
